WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:01.534
Congressman Jorge Santos

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.602
says he is innocent

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.070
of the latest reported allegation

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:04.771
against him.

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.072
The finances of the Long Island

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.140
congressman are under federal

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.174
and local investigation.

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.809
He's also the subject of a House ethics

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.444
committee investigation, as you know.

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.279
Now he's accused of orchestrating

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:13.813
a credit

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.448
and debit card skimming operation

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:18.985
in Seattle involving ATMs back in 2017.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.755
Randi Kaye has details.

00:00:22.389 --> 00:00:24.024
I was an asset in helping

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.459
take down a ring of criminals.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:27.093
New York

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.061
Congressman Jorge

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:30.030
Santos denying allegations

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.331
from a man from Brazil,

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:31.965
painting him

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:32.966
as the mastermind

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:34.567
of a credit card scheme.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:35.702
I'm innocent.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:36.503
I never did

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:38.071
anything of criminal activity.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.773
And I am no mastermind of that.

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:41.641
Santos claims of innocence

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:42.409
are in response

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:43.643
to this sworn statement

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:45.979
by the man, Gustavo Ribeiro Trillo.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.514
In his declaration

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:49.149
first published by Politico

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:50.183
Trevor alleges

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:52.085
that Santos taught him how to clone

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:53.987
ATM and credit cards

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:55.321
and that the two had agreed

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.624
to a 50 50 split of proceeds.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.026
Trello wrote in the Declaration.

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:01.761
Santos gave me at his warehouse

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:03.763
some of the parts to illegally skim

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:05.298
credit card information

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:06.866
right after he gave me the card

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.435
skimming and cloning machines.

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.170
He taught me how to use them.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.337
Trevor has reportedly

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.572
submitted his declaration

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.606
to the FBI

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:14.641
and other federal

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:16.543
law enforcement officials.

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:18.812
Santos, meanwhile, told reporters today

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.413
he wasn't the organizer

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:22.449
but the guy who helped crack the case.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:23.883
Then I cooperated with

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.351
Secret Service, FBI.

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.020
Everybody that asked for my help

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.421
got information for them.

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.090
Got everybody arrested and deported.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.524
I'm not the mastermind of the story.

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.827
This all goes back to 2017.

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:35.195
When Trello pleaded guilty

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:36.930
to access device fraud

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:37.764
in Seattle,

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:38.498
Federal Records

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:40.400
show Trevor had been arrested

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.502
after using a credit card skimming device

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:44.971
and electronic camera on ATMs

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:47.040
to steal credit and debit card numbers

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:47.774
as well.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.008
As ATM pin numbers,

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:50.710
according to court documents.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.279
Politico reports that in 2016

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.881
a year earlier, Trevor

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:56.583
had rented a room in Santos's

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.518
Winter Park, Florida, apartment.

00:01:58.518 --> 00:01:59.786
When asked about this,

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:00.787
Santos quickly

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:02.522
distanced himself from Trello.

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:03.423
It was never my roommate

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:04.424
never left with me.

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:06.259
I saw him maybe a couple of times

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:08.728
in my life. Yet back in 2017.

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:10.830
According to audio obtained by CNN,

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.499
Santos appeared in court

00:02:12.499 --> 00:02:13.933
on Triller's behalf.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.001
At that court hearing,

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.669
Santos described Triller

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.238
as a family friend.

00:02:18.238 --> 00:02:18.872
In court,

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:20.640
Santos also lied to the judge

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.841
about where he worked.

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:24.677
What do you do for work or fishing?

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:25.612
I work for Goldman.

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:27.180
If you work for Goldman Sachs,

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.114
in New York.

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.216
The congressman has since acknowledged

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:31.351
he never worked directly

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:32.485
for Goldman Sachs.

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:33.086
The investment

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:35.488
giant CNN has not verify

00:02:35.488 --> 00:02:37.924
the authenticity of Triller's declaration

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:39.893
and Triller's attorney has not responded

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:42.395
to CNN's repeated phone calls and emails.

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:45.231
CNN has also reached out to the FBI

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:46.833
and the Department of Justice

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:48.067
for comment.

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:50.036
The allegation against Santos comes

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.271
as the freshman congressman

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:52.805
is already facing intense

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:54.307
scrutiny over fabrications

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:56.609
about his biography and resume.

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:58.444
Local and federal prosecutors

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:00.613
are also investigating his finances.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:01.414
The House

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:03.183
Ethics Committee is also looking into

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:04.250
whether Santos

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.686
may have engaged in unlawful activity

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:09.622
during his successful 2022 campaign.

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:10.490
I'm very confident

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.091
I can fight this when it's very easy.

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.893
Randi Kaye, CNN.

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:15.461
A group of

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:17.030
New York Republican congressmen recently

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.498
introduced a bill that would ban

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:19.199
House members

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:19.832
like Santos

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:21.367
from profiting off book, movie

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.268
or TV deals

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:22.869
if indicted

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:24.070
or convicted of certain crimes

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:25.471
like financial and campaign

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:26.673
finance fraud.

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:27.540
Just before airtime,

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.741
I spoke to one of those members,

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:29.409
Congressman Brandon

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:31.644
Williams, who has also called for Mr.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:34.380
Santos to step down

00:03:35.081 --> 00:03:35.715
Congressman Williams,

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:36.649
I appreciate you joining us.

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:37.817
I wonder what your reaction was

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:38.952
to these allegations

00:03:38.952 --> 00:03:40.420
that Congressman Santos

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.590
was involved in this credit card scheme.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.124
Well, I tell you, it

00:03:45.124 --> 00:03:47.160
you know, I guess it was an ATM scheme.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.561
It looks like it's been yeah.

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:50.563
He's been using the

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:50.763
you know,

00:03:50.763 --> 00:03:51.731
it looks like he's been using

00:03:51.731 --> 00:03:53.766
Nassau County donors as ATMs

00:03:53.967 --> 00:03:55.702
and he just upped his game.

00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:57.870
So I think it's a continuation

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.573
of a frankly, of a big confidence scheme.

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:03.176
Very much like Bernie Madoff.

00:04:03.176 --> 00:04:05.278
And it's all being exposed.

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:07.714
So the fact that his deception goes

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:08.948
much farther back doesn't

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:09.983
surprise me at all.

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:12.018
I mean, if the allegations are true,

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:14.554
they were made in a sworn statement

00:04:14.554 --> 00:04:15.421
by the person

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:16.623
who was actually prosecuted

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:18.391
for involvement in this A.T.M.

00:04:18.391 --> 00:04:19.425
scheme.

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:21.594
It's a pretty complex operation.

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:22.862
I mean, it involved it

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.797
according again, to this

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:27.133
person who was was convicted

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:29.235
in a warehouse in Florida

00:04:29.235 --> 00:04:30.903
being taught by Santos

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:32.639
how to use the equipment,

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:33.873
sending him to Seattle

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:35.041
where they would split the proceeds.

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:35.875
50 50.

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:37.343
Can you

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:40.713
imagine how excited, you know, Mr.

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:41.881
Santos must be

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:43.349
or must have been to realize

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:44.217
that he could,

00:04:44.217 --> 00:04:46.219
you know, do something on a larger scale,

00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:47.520
even running for Congress,

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.455
not once, but twice.

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:51.624
You know, remember that Bernie Madoff

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:54.093
cheated a lot of very sophisticated

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:56.195
people out of their money.

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:59.332
And I think that George Santos

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:00.500
has cheated a whole lot

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:01.934
of sophisticated voters

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:03.803
out of their vote.

00:05:04.237 --> 00:05:06.606
Do do you have much confidence

00:05:06.606 --> 00:05:08.341
in the in the ethics process

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:09.275
in the in the House?

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:10.376
Obviously, this has been forwarded

00:05:10.376 --> 00:05:11.344
to the Ethics Committee.

00:05:11.344 --> 00:05:11.944
I don't know if they'll look

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:12.211
at these

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:14.380
additional allegations as well

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.049
or if they'll have to just wait

00:05:16.049 --> 00:05:17.684
for to see if law enforcement

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:18.885
does anything.

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:19.819
Well, I'm

00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:20.620
confident of a couple

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:21.921
of things, Anderson.

00:05:21.921 --> 00:05:22.622
I'm confident

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:24.390
that leadership has taken the steps

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:25.358
to initiate

00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:26.326
this ethics

00:05:26.326 --> 00:05:28.828
investigation, that it will be thorough.

00:05:29.228 --> 00:05:30.563
I'm actually confident

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:34.801
that the FEC similarly will do

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:35.768
its investigation

00:05:35.768 --> 00:05:36.202
and appears

00:05:36.202 --> 00:05:38.071
like there's a lot to look at there.

00:05:38.071 --> 00:05:40.273
I know that Nassau County

00:05:40.273 --> 00:05:42.475
prosecutors are also looking

00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:42.775
and I

00:05:42.775 --> 00:05:43.710
guarantee you

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:46.379
that they will do a very exceptional job.

00:05:46.612 --> 00:05:47.380
And I'm confident

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:47.947
that we're going to see

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:49.949
George Santos in handcuffs

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:52.452
in front of a judge hopefully not

00:05:53.419 --> 00:05:54.887
just to distant future.

00:05:54.887 --> 00:05:56.923
Well, you really believe that?

00:05:56.923 --> 00:05:59.292
I do. Absolutely.

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:00.960
Do you think he's getting any work done?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.328
I mean, you know how difficult it is

00:06:02.328 --> 00:06:03.429
being a congressperson,

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:04.831
all the different things

00:06:04.831 --> 00:06:05.398
going on,

00:06:05.398 --> 00:06:06.799
all the responsibilities you have

00:06:06.799 --> 00:06:07.266
if you care

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:08.901
about the people in your district,

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:09.869
which I mean,

00:06:09.869 --> 00:06:12.772
can he actually get anything done?

00:06:12.772 --> 00:06:14.841
Well, I think I know that

00:06:15.074 --> 00:06:17.477
his neighbors like Anthony Esposito,

00:06:18.144 --> 00:06:20.813
Nicola Loder, Nicole Malliotakis,

00:06:20.813 --> 00:06:22.648
they've all opened up their offices

00:06:22.648 --> 00:06:24.517
for constituents,

00:06:24.517 --> 00:06:25.651
you know, on Long Island

00:06:25.651 --> 00:06:26.552
and in the vicinity

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:28.388
to use their offices

00:06:28.388 --> 00:06:29.822
for whatever services are needed.

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:31.290
So I think there's been

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.258
a lot of help

00:06:32.258 --> 00:06:34.460
offered in in terms of his role.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.763
He's not on any committees.

00:06:36.763 --> 00:06:39.332
He's not very popular.

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:40.600
I can tell you that

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:43.169
and I'm not sure what,

00:06:43.169 --> 00:06:43.503
you know,

00:06:43.503 --> 00:06:45.638
what work that he might be getting done.

00:06:45.938 --> 00:06:47.940
What concerns me, Anderson, is that

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:51.411
he still has a security clearance and

00:06:51.978 --> 00:06:53.613
and therefore, as a member of Congress,

00:06:53.613 --> 00:06:54.580
is actually entitled

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:58.117
to briefings that involve top secret

00:06:59.419 --> 00:07:01.421
information That concerns me a lot.

00:07:01.421 --> 00:07:02.722
And I think that needs to be looked at.

00:07:02.722 --> 00:07:03.890
It's also the last

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:04.957
thing Republicans

00:07:04.957 --> 00:07:07.727
need, distracting people from what,

00:07:07.727 --> 00:07:08.594
you know, everybody in

00:07:08.594 --> 00:07:10.229
Congress is supposed to be doing.

00:07:10.229 --> 00:07:13.032
Well, I would say the the issue

00:07:13.032 --> 00:07:14.267
that I'm most concerned with

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:16.502
is that the people of Nassau County

00:07:17.203 --> 00:07:20.640
are the victims here and their victims

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:22.375
because they were defrauded

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:24.243
out of the right to be represented.

00:07:24.243 --> 00:07:26.746
I think the house is also the victim.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.080
And

00:07:28.748 --> 00:07:30.216
so those are the things that are

00:07:30.216 --> 00:07:32.218
sort of top of mind when I think about

00:07:32.218 --> 00:07:33.586
what's happened with George Xenos.

00:07:33.586 --> 00:07:34.887
Had you run into him at all?

00:07:34.887 --> 00:07:35.888
I mean, have you said anything to him

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:38.458
ever? I bumped into him on the floor.

00:07:38.491 --> 00:07:40.560
And I have to tell you, it's awkward

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.795
because

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:43.663
because he was part

00:07:43.663 --> 00:07:45.965
of the New York delegation.

00:07:45.965 --> 00:07:48.067
I never met him in person until

00:07:48.401 --> 00:07:49.769
until we were an orientation

00:07:49.769 --> 00:07:50.770
my wife and I extended

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:53.239
the hand of friendship as we did.

00:07:53.372 --> 00:07:55.274
You know, all the new members. And,

00:07:56.409 --> 00:07:56.909
you know,

00:07:56.909 --> 00:07:58.578
within probably a week or two

00:07:58.578 --> 00:08:00.379
that the wheels started coming off.

00:08:00.379 --> 00:08:02.815
And I found that pretty disappointing.

00:08:02.849 --> 00:08:03.382
Yeah.

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:04.116
Well, Congressman Williams,

00:08:04.116 --> 00:08:05.117
I really appreciate your time tonight.

00:08:05.117 --> 00:08:06.752
Thank you. Yes, sir. Thank you.

